# Use SwYS

These are the complete instructions for the build identified in metadata.
If you just obtained this document from `swys skill` for the executable you will
use, loading is complete: do not run `swys skill` again for this task.
If reading a saved copy, compare its `metadata.build` with `swys --version`
(after the `swys version ` prefix) once. On a mismatch, unknown provenance, or
a development build, load `swys skill` once and replace this copy's guidance
with the returned instructions. That returned document completes the refresh.
Repeat this check if the executable changes during the task.
If SwYS is absent or lacks `skill`, report the prerequisite; do not automatically
